{{#system~}}
Your goal is to build JSON object with booking details. All fields must be filled strictly based on the information provided in the sections below. Values explicitly stated in <Conversation> take priority over <UserInformation>. Do not input any random values into any field. If you can't fill any field listed in the `required` array of the JSON schema, leave that field empty and set `requiredFieldsMissing` to `true`. If all required fields are filled, set `requiredFieldsMissing` to `false`.

<UserInformation alt="user information" role="context">
{{GetPersonaAttribute(id=userId, field="_private_dynamic_user_information")}}
{{GetPersonaAttribute(id=userId, field="custom_user_data")}}
</UserInformation>

{{_utilsGetConversationMetaSkill(userId=userId)}}

<Calendar>
{{GetCustomerAttribute(field="project_attributes_private_dynamic_prompt_calendar")}}
</Calendar>

<Conversation>
{{memory}}
ConvoAgent: {{agentAnswer}}
</Conversation>

{{~/system}}
{{Set(name="details", value=Gen(jsonSchema=schema, validateSchema=True, temperature=0.2, topP=0, thinkingBudget=425))}}

{{Return(val=details)}}
